# {{.Name}}

Generated by `gostack init` (profile lite{{if .Kit}}, kit {{.Kit}}{{end}}).

```bash
go build -o bin/{{.Name}} .
./bin/{{.Name}} --config gostack.yaml doctor
./bin/{{.Name}} --config gostack.yaml migrate up
{{- if .Game}}
./bin/{{.Name}} --config gostack.yaml game create demo --origin http://localhost:5173
./bin/{{.Name}} --config gostack.yaml game config publish demo game-config.json
{{- end}}
{{- if .Agent}}
./bin/{{.Name}} --config gostack.yaml apikey create --name runner --scope agent --tenant default
{{- end}}
{{- if .Web}}
./bin/{{.Name}} --config gostack.yaml apikey create --name editor --scope web --tenant default
{{- end}}
./bin/{{.Name}} --config gostack.yaml serve
```

Deployment templates live in `deploy/` (systemd unit, Litestream config). Read
them before use: paths, user and bucket names must be adapted.
